{"action":"propose_candidate","purpose":"用直接实数快速傅里叶变换和受保护的单精度计算降低长序列全卷积的运行时间。","expected_result":"在开发规模上显著减少变换与内存访问成本，同时对动态范围异常或卷积严重相消的输入退回双精度计算。","verification":"由原生评估器检查输出形状、相对二范数误差以及全部计时样本相对基线的严格优势。","hypothesis":"开发输入的卷积条件通常足以支持单精度快速傅里叶变换达到百万分之一的相对误差；能量检查可识别需要双精度的明显病态输入。","analysis":"基线包含卷积方法选择和通用封装开销。直接调用实数变换并使用原位频域乘法可减少这些开销；单精度变换还可降低计算量。对较短输入使用直接卷积，对不适合单精度的输入使用双精度变换。","tool":null,"candidate_id":null,"parent_candidate_id":"c0","code":"import numpy as np
from scipy.fft import rfft, irfft, next_fast_len


def _double(a, b, size, nfft):
    fa = rfft(a, n=nfft)
    fb = rfft(b, n=nfft)
    fa *= fb
    return irfft(fa, n=nfft, overwrite_x=True)[:size]


def solve(problem):
    a, b = problem
    na, nb = len(a), len(b)
    size = na + nb - 1
    if min(na, nb) <= 32 or na * nb <= 8192:
        return np.convolve(a, b)
    nfft = next_fast_len(size, real=True)
    if nfft > 262144:
        return _double(a, b, size, nfft)
    ea = float(np.einsum('i,i->', a, a))
    eb = float(np.einsum('i,i->', b, b))
    if not (1e-24 < ea < 1e24 and 1e-24 < eb < 1e24):
        return _double(a, b, size, nfft)
    fa = rfft(np.asarray(a, dtype=np.float32), n=nfft)
    fb = rfft(np.asarray(b, dtype=np.float32), n=nfft)
    fa *= fb
    result = irfft(fa, n=nfft, overwrite_x=True)[:size]
    ec = float(np.einsum('i,i->', result, result, dtype=np.float64))
    if not (ec >= 0.5 * ea * eb and np.isfinite(ec)):
        return _double(a, b, size, nfft)
    return result
